        "# cFish.io WordPress Maintenance Checklist\r",
        "\r",
        "This checklist outlines routine maintenance tasks to keep the cFish.io WordPress site secure, performant, and reliable.\r",
        "\r",
        "## Weekly Maintenance\r",
        "\r",
        "### Security\r",
        "- [ ] Check for WordPress core updates\r",
        "- [ ] Check for theme updates\r",
        "- [ ] Check for plugin updates\r",
        "- [ ] Review user accounts for unauthorized changes\r",
        "- [ ] Review site for suspicious activity\r",
        "- [ ] Check security plugin logs (if applicable)\r",
        "\r",
        "### Performance\r",
        "- [ ] Review site load times\r",
        "- [ ] Check for 404 errors in logs\r",
        "- [ ] Monitor for broken links\r",
        "- [ ] Verify forms are working properly\r",
        "- [ ] Test contact methods (email, forms, etc.)\r",
        "\r",
        "### Content\r",
        "- [ ] Review recent content for quality/errors\r",
        "- [ ] Check commenting functionality\r",
        "- [ ] Verify social media integration\r",
        "- [ ] Review site analytics for unusual patterns\r",
        "\r",
        "## Monthly Maintenance\r",
        "\r",
        "### Security\r",
        "- [ ] Run security scan of the website\r",
        "- [ ] Change admin passwords\r",
        "- [ ] Verify file permissions\r",
        "- [ ] Review user roles and capabilities\r",
        "- [ ] Test backup/restore functionality\r",
        "- [ ] Check SSL certificate validity\r",
        "\r",
        "### Database\r",
        "- [ ] Optimize WordPress database\r",
        "- [ ] Remove spam comments\r",
        "- [ ] Clean up post revisions\r",
        "- [ ] Remove unapproved comments\r",
        "- [ ] Clean up trashed posts/pages\r",
        "\r",
        "### Performance\r",
        "- [ ] Run performance audit (Google PageSpeed or similar)\r",
        "- [ ] Optimize images that need compression\r",
        "- [ ] Check and optimize largest contentful paint (LCP)\r",
        "- [ ] Review and clean up unnecessary plugins\r",
        "- [ ] Test website functionality on mobile devices\r",
        "- [ ] Run cross-browser compatibility tests\r",
        "\r",
        "### Content\r",
        "- [ ] Check for outdated content\r",
        "- [ ] Update copyright year (if needed)\r",
        "- [ ] Verify contact information is current\r",
        "- [ ] Review and update SEO metadata\r",
        "- [ ] Update XML sitemap\r",
        "\r",
        "## Quarterly Maintenance\r",
        "\r",
        "### Backup Verification\r",
        "- [ ] Create full site backup\r",
        "- [ ] Verify backup integrity by performing test restore\r",
        "- [ ] Store backup offsite\r",
        "- [ ] Document backup procedure and location\r",
        "\r",
        "### Development Environment\r",
        "- [ ] Sync production site to development\r",
        "- [ ] Verify development environment matches production\r",
        "- [ ] Clean up development database\r",
        "- [ ] Update development documentation\r",
        "\r",
        "### Code Review\r",
        "- [ ] Review theme customizations\r",
        "- [ ] Check for deprecated functions\r",
        "- [ ] Update any outdated code patterns\r",
        "- [ ] Review and clean up functions.php\r",
        "- [ ] Check for plugin conflicts or redundancies\r",
        "\r",
        "### Performance Optimization\r",
        "- [ ] Conduct full performance audit\r",
        "- [ ] Optimize database tables\r",
        "- [ ] Review and optimize CSS/JS loading\r",
        "- [ ] Check for render-blocking resources\r",
        "- [ ] Review hosting plan for adequacy\r",
        "\r",
        "### Content Audit\r",
        "- [ ] Full content inventory\r",
        "- [ ] Check for thin or duplicate content\r",
        "- [ ] Update old posts with current information\r",
        "- [ ] Review internal linking structure\r",
        "- [ ] Check and fix broken links\r",
        "\r",
        "## Annual Maintenance\r",
        "\r",
        "### Strategic Review\r",
        "- [ ] Review website goals and metrics\r",
        "- [ ] Check if design needs refreshing\r",
        "- [ ] Evaluate theme for continued suitability\r",
        "- [ ] Consider major version upgrades\r",
        "- [ ] Conduct user experience review\r",
        "\r",
        "### Full Security Audit\r",
        "- [ ] Comprehensive security scan\r",
        "- [ ] Review all user accounts and permissions\r",
        "- [ ] Consider changing all passwords\r",
        "- [ ] Review security policies\r",
        "- [ ] Verify recovery procedures\r",
        "\r",
        "### Infrastructure Evaluation\r",
        "- [ ] Review hosting provider performance\r",
        "- [ ] Consider CDN implementation/changes\r",
        "- [ ] Evaluate SSL certificate (renewal date, strength)\r",
        "- [ ] Review domain registration expiration\r",
        "- [ ] Evaluate email delivery performance\r",
        "\r",
        "### Documentation Update\r",
        "- [ ] Update all website documentation\r",
        "- [ ] Review and update SOPs\r",
        "- [ ] Document custom functionality\r",
        "- [ ] Update disaster recovery plan\r",
        "- [ ] Review and update changelog\r",
        "\r",
        "## Post-Update Checklist\r",
        "\r",
        "Run this checklist after any significant update to WordPress core, themes, or plugins:\r",
        "\r",
        "### Functionality Verification\r",
        "- [ ] Check site frontend for visual issues\r",
        "- [ ] Verify all critical pages load correctly\r",
        "- [ ] Test all forms and interactive elements\r",
        "- [ ] Check admin dashboard functionality\r",
        "- [ ] Verify media uploads work correctly\r",
        "\r",
        "### Compatibility Check\r",
        "- [ ] Test on multiple browsers\r",
        "- [ ] Test on mobile devices\r",
        "- [ ] Check custom functionality\r",
        "- [ ] Verify third-party integrations\r",
        "- [ ] Test e-commerce functionality (if applicable)\r",
        "\r",
        "### Performance Impact\r",
        "- [ ] Check site loading speed\r",
        "- [ ] Monitor error logs for new issues\r",
        "- [ ] Check database performance\r",
        "- [ ] Verify caching is working properly\r",
        "\r",
        "## Emergency Response Checklist\r",
        "\r",
        "Use this checklist when responding to site issues:\r",
        "\r",
        "### Website Down\r",
        "- [ ] Check hosting status\r",
        "- [ ] Verify DNS configuration\r",
        "- [ ] Check for recent changes that might have caused the issue\r",
        "- [ ] Review server error logs\r",
        "- [ ] Contact hosting provider if needed\r",
        "\r",
        "### Security Breach\r",
        "- [ ] Take site offline if necessary\r",
        "- [ ] Change all passwords\r",
        "- [ ] Scan for malware\r",
        "- [ ] Remove unauthorized users\r",
        "- [ ] Restore from clean backup\r",
        "- [ ] Document the incident\r",
        "\r",
        "### Performance Issues\r",
        "- [ ] Check for resource limits (CPU, memory)\r",
        "- [ ] Review active plugins\r",
        "- [ ] Check for database issues\r",
        "- [ ] Review recent traffic patterns\r",
        "- [ ] Temporarily disable suspect plugins\r",
        "\r",
        "## Maintenance Log\r",
        "\r",
        "| Date       | Maintenance Performed                           | Performed By | Notes                       |\r",
        "|------------|------------------------------------------------|--------------|------------------------------|\r",
        "| YYYY-MM-DD | Example: Weekly maintenance, plugin updates     | Your Name    | Updated 3 plugins, all good |\r",
        "|            |                                                |              |                              |\r",
        "|            |                                                |              |                              |\r",
        "\r",
        "## Maintenance Resources\r",
        "\r",
        "- [WordPress Codex](https://codex.wordpress.org/)\r",
        "- [WordPress.org Forums](https://wordpress.org/support/forums/)\r",
        "- [WordPress Maintenance Documentation](https://wordpress.org/support/article/administration-screens/)\r",
        "- [Google PageSpeed Insights](https://pagespeed.web.dev/)\r",
        "- [GTmetrix](https://gtmetrix.com/)\r",
        "- [WordPress Security Best Practices](https://wordpress.org/support/article/hardening-wordpress/)"
      ]
    }
